Layered\ architecture\ considering\ only\ dependencies\ in\ layers,\ consisting\ of\nlayer\ 'Web'\ ('com.example.shop.web..')\nlayer\ 'Application'\ ('com.example.shop.application..')\nlayer\ 'Domain'\ ('com.example.shop.domain..')\nlayer\ 'Infrastructure'\ ('com.example.shop.infrastructure..')\nwhere\ layer\ 'Web'\ may\ not\ be\ accessed\ by\ any\ layer\nwhere\ layer\ 'Application'\ may\ only\ be\ accessed\ by\ layers\ ['Web']\nwhere\ layer\ 'Domain'\ may\ only\ be\ accessed\ by\ layers\ ['Application',\ 'Infrastructure',\ 'Web']\nwhere\ layer\ 'Infrastructure'\ may\ not\ be\ accessed\ by\ any\ layer,\ because\ the\ web\ layer\ talks\ to\ use\ cases,\ and\ only\ the\ composition\ root\ wires\ in\ infrastructure=67ceffdf-e124-4d35-a277-6cd005e0205c
